{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣資深歌手庾澄慶剛剛在北京完成《整晚哈音樂》，他在演唱會中以《情非得已》、《讓我一次愛個夠》等曲目引發全場合唱，更邀得A-Lin作為嘉賓登台合作《失戀無罪》，令歌迷歡喜若狂。不過，原定11月14日的廣州站卻突然宣布因故延期，歌迷感到相當意外，大會發出通告表示將會向歌迷作全額退款。有傳臨時延期與門票銷情有關。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:48.735245+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:06:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.778507+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:10.159761+00:00","content_hash":"063c3f078c93e82c174fa933cc43db8913377d8cf61c97b8716e7d1b113841a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:48.735245+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}